# AI / Human Collaboration

- Every change requires a GitHub issue (task/bug/feature) and a dedicated branch.
- PR must use the mandatory template (`.github/pull_request_template.md`).
- CI must pass (rust / dependency-policy / merge-guard).
- At least 1 review required (code + security when auth/tenancy/secrets change).
- Agent actions tracked: commit tags `[agent:<harness>]`, PR body agent fields, audit artifacts.
- Never push directly to `main`; never approve own PR; never merge without authorization.
- Recovery: see `docs/recovery.md`; backup tags `pre-merge-*`; revert workflow available.
